(text "OUTPUT: +5V_BUCK -> existing F2 (1A) -> +5V_AB -> A/B electronics. Heater power stays on protected 24V.\nVCC_INTERNAL is not an external 5V output. PG_5V_TP is a 5V-domain scope point, not ESP32-safe.\nFinal integration must pull PG to 3V3 if used by MCU, and deliberately connect logic/power returns; no CC shunt remains." (at 20 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f955c587-ffcf-5b86-b03b-306407f7f8cc))
(text "Nominal output: 1V * (1 + 100k / 24.9k) = 5.016V. 4 x 22uF output bank; simulate 44uF effective worst case.\nModel: TI SNVMBX7A / LMR36520A_TRANS, unencrypted PSpice. Temperature and enclosure cooling are not modeled.\nNative ngspice attempts are documented as NON-CONVERGENT, not successful functional validation." (at 20 246 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5446fa19-47ba-535d-a3d9-968b5ddeeabb))
(text "No manufacturing release: PCB layout, capacitor DC bias, thermal pad/vias, USB power sharing, sourcing and bench tests pending." (at 20 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9cfaa831-71c9-5264-a1df-0d5c0b055f4e))
